    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43843" root="&#xA;                        نجم&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجْمٌ</span></b> 
                         [<i>A star.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, <i>An asterism, or constellation:</i> being applied autonomastically to]
<i>the Pleiades.</i> (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُجُومٌ</span> [like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِرْقٌ</span>] signifies
also The <i>sprouts from the roots</i> [of a tree, or
shrub], <i>before the</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَبِيع</span> [meaning either <i>spring</i>
or <i>autumn</i>], <i>the heads of which one sees like
large needles, clearing the ground.</i> (TA.)
See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُسْلُوجٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجْمٌ</span> also signifies (tropical:)  The <i>time
when a payment falls due.</i> (Msb.) [Hence,
app., an ex. cited voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طىٌّ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  And hence,
(Msb,) (tropical:)  <i>An instalment:</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَظِيفَةٌ</span>. (Mgh,
Msb.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَزْلٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b6-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجْمٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجْمَةٌ</span>
                        <i>A kind
of plant, triticum repens</i> or <i>dogs' grass:</i> see
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثِيلٌ</span>.

